entic, engaging education without travel, without borders, and with unlimited possibilities. Join us and be part of the future of learning.", "short_description": "Immersive VR classroom with live teachers, interactive board, and personal notebooks \u2013 real education without borders."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "2907926936080689", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2907926939414022_765797073903788866_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KDtGaaYZDtsQ7kNvwHx2sCe&_nc_oc=AdogdQeaT2AgzHDX1p-hhKhWUzjc1ZCh6d83awHzvAn3_LZdHS94724RNCm1-OObAko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRis_6ccq091Xu4auI6WmVmaI3wPNkSfwxLmXlH-cbp6w&oe=6B04876F"}, {"file_name": "Landscape2560x1440.png", "id": "1863250024613411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308026_1863250027946744_9021948593827972383_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8F1xQxH0vrEQ7kNvwGewESb&_nc_oc=Adon8ye6Z6On4lVfXMI_iJnvwBFvRijOfQegzPa8XAXNG3Bj6aUuVMFVFPom3tPxlZs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRia0ntAxH-u1VBh3mmxTA4JOMOR-OQNBT63xPS6FeWKg&oe=6B046DAD"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogo.png", "id": "1354178952944489", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1354178956277822_7078438908620814251_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BPa1wBofhrUQ7kNvwElb_9V&_nc_oc=AdptCGDpW43hPmMY1HYFHRY09nOfUQVMN9Mw8G3JsRrdQgOZ_I2l9NH1BAjULQ9MfB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR71LdjN6DabesNPofGnp-ISdzYsxvC4-LM-WsVvBGOoA&oe=6B0465B9"}, {"file_name": "UtopiLogotrans.png", "id": "1305409841177830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/49